%% title: EUDI Credential Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING_VERIFICATION : party onboarded\n(identity not yet verified)
    PENDING_VERIFICATION --> UNDER_REVIEW : deduplication trigger\n(RN_COLLISION / NAMESAKE / PROBABILISTIC)
    UNDER_REVIEW --> VERIFIED : four-eyes adjudication\napproved
    UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : adjudication denied
    VERIFIED --> OFFER_CREATED : credential offer\nissued to wallet
    OFFER_CREATED --> CREDENTIAL_ISSUED : wallet redeems offer\n(status_list=VALID)
    CREDENTIAL_ISSUED --> SUSPENDED : issuer suspends\n(status_list=SUSPENDED)
    CREDENTIAL_ISSUED --> REVOKED : issuer revokes\n(status_list=REVOKED)
    SUSPENDED --> CREDENTIAL_ISSUED : suspension lifted
    SUSPENDED --> REVOKED : escalation
    REVOKED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
